Pouring more energy into your rifts, you have a [12%, 20%, 26%, 31%, 35% (TL1-5)] chance for each one to instead appear as a more powerful type.

Nether Breach: Fires a beam dealing [35, 47, 56, 64, 71 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage at a random target in radius 10.

Temporal Vortex: Inflicts [29, 39, 46, 53, 58 (TL1-5; SP 100)] temporal damage each turn to enemies in radius 4 and reduces their global speed by 30%.

Dimensional Gate: Has a 50% chance each turn to summon a voidling lasting [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns; a fast melee attacker that can teleport.

The stats of your Void Skitterers will scale with your Magic stat and level.
